{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;They fall from the skies. They are not just meteors. They are alive. And they want everything.&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014 <i>Commander Rhaegon Voss, BCF High Command</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Blackrock</i>, you are the last line of defense \u2014 a Commander of the <strong>Blackrock Containment Force (BCF)</strong>. Your mission: stop the spread of a sentient meteorite known only as <i>the Blackrock</i>, before it corrupts the planet entirely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dropped into hostile terrain with only a <strong>portal</strong>, a <strong>shard generator</strong>, and your <strong>launchpad</strong>, you\u2019ll need to summon and command units called <strong>Bravelings</strong> \u2014 autonomous fighters born to resist the Glimmergrubs, the grotesque minions spawned by the Blackrock.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Command the BCF</strong> \u2013 Step into the boots of a tactical Commander with real-time combat control.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fend off Glimmergrubs</strong> \u2013 Face swarms of corrupted enemies that evolve and swarm relentlessly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Summon Bravelings</strong> \u2013 Use collected <strong>shards</strong> to deploy autonomous soldiers that fight by your side.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade Everything</strong> \u2013 Enhance your troops, defenses, generator, and your own combat skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical Base Defense</strong> \u2013 Protect the generator, and outlast the corruption.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-Paced Pixel Combat</strong> \u2013\u00a0 Shoot with precision in animated pixel style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Destroy the Blackrock</strong> \u2013 The fight isn\u2019t over until the Blackrock is destroyed.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Blackrock</i> originally began as a small learning project to explore coding, game design, and the possibilities of GameMaker. Over time, it steadily grew into a larger experience \u2014 one that continues to evolve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a long-term passion project, developed and expanded step by step. <br>Development is ongoing, with regular updates, gameplay improvements, and new features planned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you for your interest in <i>Blackrock</i>. The fight against corruption has only just begun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014 Joe from\u00a0<i>Cavedwarf Studios</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3752770?t=1768499433","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752770/916a3504046b8e08f920b80db18cb65d7455d6aa/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768499433","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752770/b6049eb2791170ad3ed3cbea4d0b03fe3e6f03fd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768499433","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752770/b6049eb2791170ad3ed3cbea4d0b03fe3e6f03fd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768499433","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;They fall from the skies. They are not just meteors. They are alive. And they want everything.&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014 <i>Commander Rhaegon Voss, BCF High Command</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Blackrock</i>, you are the last line of defense \u2014 a Commander of the <strong>Blackrock Containment Force (BCF)</strong>. Your mission: stop the spread of a sentient meteorite known only as <i>the Blackrock</i>, before it corrupts the planet entirely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dropped into hostile terrain with only a <strong>portal</strong>, a <strong>shard generator</strong>, and your <strong>launchpad</strong>, you\u2019ll need to summon and command units called <strong>Bravelings</strong> \u2014 autonomous fighters born to resist the Glimmergrubs, the grotesque minions spawned by the Blackrock.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Command the BCF</strong> \u2013 Step into the boots of a tactical Commander with real-time combat control.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fend off Glimmergrubs</strong> \u2013 Face swarms of corrupted enemies that evolve and swarm relentlessly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Summon Bravelings</strong> \u2013 Use collected <strong>shards</strong> to deploy autonomous soldiers that fight by your side.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade Everything</strong> \u2013 Enhance your troops, defenses, generator, and your own combat skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical Base Defense</strong> \u2013 Protect the generator, and outlast the corruption.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-Paced Pixel Combat</strong> \u2013\u00a0 Shoot with precision in animated pixel style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Destroy the Blackrock</strong> \u2013 The fight isn\u2019t over until the Blackrock is destroyed.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Blackrock</i> originally began as a small learning project to explore coding, game design, and the possibilities of GameMaker. Over time, it steadily grew into a larger experience \u2014 one that continues to evolve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a long-term passion project, developed and expanded step by step. <br>Development is ongoing, with regular updates, gameplay improvements, and new features planned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you for your interest in <i>Blackrock</i>. The fight against corruption has only just begun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014 Joe from\u00a0<i>Cavedwarf Studios</i></p>","developers":["Johannes Elsasser"],"dlc":[3925010],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752770/2a1c3590089584ac45dade7dc51044014a3bec3d/header.jpg?t=1768499433","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 Johannes Elsasser. Published by Cavedwarf Studios. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3752770/180214592/4872d1767bc96a74a3f5354fc193ab5509233997/1765236414/dash_av1.mpd?t=1765237299","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3752770/180214592/4872d1767bc96a74a3f5354fc193ab5509233997/1765236414/dash_h264.mpd?t=1765237299","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3752770/180214592/4872d1767bc96a74a3f5354fc193ab5509233997/1765236414/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1765237299","id":257245439,"name":"Fragmented Soul: Blackrock v0.6.0.0 Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257245439/9f2c6a088c16fab85bb055c2fbad867781a3f0cf/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1765237299"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3752770/455808466/9a2fe5e8b03444